{"term": {"label": "親", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "5A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/wan-zhang-i", "title": "萬章上", "description": "萬章問曰：「舜往于田，號泣于旻天，何為其號泣也？」\n孟子曰：「怨慕也。」\n萬章曰：「父母愛之，喜而不忘；父母惡之，勞而不怨。然則舜怨乎？」\n曰：「長息問於公明高曰：『舜往于田，則吾既得聞命矣；號泣于旻天，于父母，則吾不知也。』公明高曰：『是非爾所知也。』夫公明高以孝子之心，為不若是恝，我竭力耕田，共為子職而已矣，父母之", "occurrences": 6, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "勞", "id": "勞"}, {"form": "命", "id": "命"}, {"form": "士", "id": "士"}, {"form": "天下", "id": "天下"}, {"form": "天子", "id": "天子"}, {"form": "好", "id": "好"}, {"form": "富", "id": "富"}, {"form": "封", "id": "封"}, {"form": "尊", "id": "尊"}, {"form": "崩", "id": "崩"}, {"form": "後", "id": "後"}, {"form": "從", "id": "從"}, {"form": "德", "id": "德"}, {"form": "愛", "id": "愛"}, {"form": "憂", "id": "憂"}, {"form": "欲", "id": "欲"}, {"form": "父", "id": "父"}, {"form": "父母", "id": "父母"}, {"form": "至", "id": "至"}, {"form": "色", "id": "色"}, {"form": "親", "variants": [], "id": "親"}, {"form": "解", "id": "解"}, {"form": "貴", "id": "貴"}, {"form": "養", "id": "養"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.2914117923959205, "source": "親", "target": "欲"}, {"weight": 2.473733349189875, "source": "親", "target": "貴"}, {"weight": 3.6777061535158113, "source": "親", "target": "尊"}, {"weight": 2.8304082931286074, "source": "親", "target": "至"}, {"weight": 1.2499579175677593, "source": "親", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 2.984558972955866, "source": "親", "target": "養"}, {"weight": 1.6852759888256048, "source": "父", "target": "天子"}, {"weight": 2.984558972955866, "source": "父", "target": "尊"}, {"weight": 2.137261112568662, "source": "父", "target": "至"}, {"weight": 0.8510502100057541, "source": "好", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.0037297199441397, "source": "好", "target": "欲"}, {"weight": 3.7954891891721947, "source": "好", "target": "色"}, {"weight": 2.186051276738094, "source": "好", "target": "富"}, {"weight": 1.8495790401168812, "source": "好", "target": "憂"}, {"weight"